cannons_count.description:
The guns and stores as listed (a change of guns, or stores taken off, cancels the listing;
the crew eats the stores down in port meanwhile). These and the name are a record of the
ship when listed, not of the ship now.

season_planned_end_at.description:
When the operators have announced this season will end (seasons run a fixed 90 real days;
the operators end each one by hand on the announced date, never automatically). `null`
until announced. The final standings are archived then: `GET /v1/world/leaderboard`.
